     "body": "<p>The following objects (at least) must be removed:</p>\n\n<p>&gt; obj_demo_6.xml<br/>\n&gt; sdep_demo_4.xml<br/>\n&gt; obj_demo_10.xml<br/>\n&gt; obj_demo_9.xml<br/>\n&gt; sdep_demo_9.xml (web service uses mrsid decoder)<br/>\n&gt; obj_demo_30.xml<br/>\n&gt; obj_demo_7.xml<br/>\n&gt; sdep_demo_3.xml</p>",
