      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Also need to remove obj_demo_11.</p>\n\n<p>This really amounts to removing all the open-server-demos objects:</p>\n\n<p>simple-image-demos:<br/>\n  demo:UVA_MRSID_IMAGE (a cmodel)<br/>\n  demo:UVA_STD_IMAGE_2 (a cmodel)<br/>\n  demo:30 (a UVA_STD_IMAGE_1) <br/>\n  demo:6 (a UVA_MRSID_IMAGE)<br/>\n  demo:7 (a UVA_STD_IMAGE_2)<br/>\n  demo:3 (a svc deployment)<br/>\n  demo:4 (a svc deployment)<br/>\nuserinput-image-demo:<br/>\n  demo:UVA_MRSID_IMAGE_1 (a cmodel)<br/>\n  demo:10 (a UVA_MRSID_IMAGE_1)<br/>\n  demo:11 (a UVA_MRSID_IMAGE_1)<br/>\n  demo:8 (a svc definition)<br/>\n  demo:9 (a svc deployment)</p>\n\n<p>They need to be removed from the tests and documentation as well.</p>",
